### Verificar se a API está funcionando
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Listar salas (público)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/rooms?page=1&size=10

### Login do administrador (dados padrão do .env.example)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@salas.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Criar sala (substitua COLE_SEU_TOKEN pelo token recebido no login)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer COLE_SEU_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Sala de Reunião",
  "capacity": 15,
  "location": "Bloco C"
}

### Consultar sala pelo ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/rooms/1

### Atualizar sala (administrador)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer COLE_SEU_TOKEN

{
  "capacity": 25
}

### Excluir sala (administrador)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/rooms/1
Authorization: Bearer COLE_SEU_TOKEN
